    <p class="email-mock-footer" style="margin-top:0;">Full schedule: <a href="#">https://your-site/schedule</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
<p class="muted">If your group didn't get to 4, you'll get a short note saying this one didn't come together. Either way, you don't need to do anything, and you'll be invited to the next one. (The forecast line only shows up if your admin turned on weather for this session. See <a href="#weather">Weather forecast</a>.)</p>

<p>Here's the whole thing in one picture:</p>
<div class="flowchart">
  <div class="flow-step">
    <div class="flow-when">About 56 hours before the game (the admin can change this)</div>
    <div class="flow-title">Invite email goes to everyone on the roster</div>
